            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Contendit sē innocentem esse. He insists that he is innocent."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "contendō, contendere, contendī, contentum. With the accusative and infinitive, to insist; with ad, to hurry to a place. English contend."
            }
          ]
        },
